        "table": null,
        "text": "Access and Technology for Everyone",
        "text_hash": "068fa324640fb2b537c22bbcb2cf22e143f71d0e65a5001b1572b759272f92de",
        "type": "heading_candidate"
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block-000066-5f2ed3aa",
        "dom_path": "/html/body/div[73]",
        "image_asset_id": null,
        "layout_role": null,
        "ordinal": 66,
        "reported_page": 3,
        "source_anchor": "i6be430fe3ebf411481dcec8b0abe9149_19",
        "style_signature": [
          [
            "font-family",
            "'arial',sans-serif"
          ],
          [
            "font-size",
            "10pt"
          ],
          [
            "font-weight",
            "400"
          ],
          [
            "line-height",
            "120%"
          ],
          [
            "margin-top",
            "6pt"
          ],
          [
            "text-align",
            "justify"
          ],
          [
            "text-indent",
            "22.5pt"
          ]
        ],
        "table": null,
        "text": "The Internet is one of the world’s most powerful equalizers; it propels ideas, people, and businesses large and small. Our mission to organize the world’s information and make it universally accessible and useful is as relevant today as it was when we were founded in 1998. Since then, we have evolved from a company that helps people find answers to a company that also helps people get things done.",
        "text_hash": "5f2ed3aa2e92eb17b139afd9de88454624c870c84dd6be9f05f133ad55991d7a",
        "type": "paragraph"
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block-000067-ab181097",
        "dom_path": "/html/body/div[74]",
        "image_asset_id": null,
        "layout_role": null,
        "ordinal": 67,
        "reported_page": 3,
        "source_anchor": "i6be430fe3ebf411481dcec8b0abe9149_19",
        "style_signature": [
          [
            "font-family",
            "'arial',sans-serif"
          ],
          [
            "font-size",
            "10pt"
          ],
          [
            "font-weight",
            "400"
          ],
          [
            "line-height",
            "120%"
          ],
          [
            "margin-top",
            "6pt"
          ],
          [
            "text-align",
            "justify"
          ],
          [
            "text-indent",
            "22.5pt"
          ]
        ],
        "table": null,
        "text": "We are focused on building an even more helpful Google for everyone, and we aspire to give everyone the tools they need to increase their knowledge, health, happiness, and success. Google Search helps people find information and make sense of the world in more natural and intuitive ways, with trillions of searches on Google every year. YouTube provides people with entertainment, information, and opportunities to learn something new and helps support the creator economy through the YouTube Partner Program. Google Cloud helps customers build for the future, improve productivity, reduce costs, and unlock new growth engines. We continually innovate and build new products and features to help our users, partners, customers, and communities and have invested more than $200 billion in research and development in the last five years in support of these efforts.",
        "text_hash": "ab181097c313f6cf2a0e7dec1c9af49d699588114f66f70364289c8239d8b305",
        "type": "paragraph"
      },
      {
